o", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-31T03:14:13Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "but not anti-placebo", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-31T03:14:20Z", "username": "Shubham", "text": "Falsebo?", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-31T03:14:24Z", "username": "Aditi Bapat", "text": "Omg I just realized this😂", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-31T03:14:38Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Placego effect?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-31T03:15:03Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "something to indicate negation", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-31T03:15:14Z", "username": "Neehaarika", "text": "Nocebo!", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": true, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-31T03:15:31Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Pleaseno effect?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-31T03:16:05Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nocebo", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-31T03:16:14Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Place-no", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-31T03:16:14Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Place-boo", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-31T03:16:47Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Keeping in mind Halloween theme", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-31T03:17:04Z", "username": "Lzafeer A